     "excerpt": "crossing the incident threshold should trigger review rather than an automatic recall. S2’s customer disclosure is not public publication, and its above-5% pathway avoids an automatic sales ban. With the six-year retrofit deadline and the other safeguards in place, Northwind can accept this version.",
